Input: {"question": "Which person or organization did Mariana Raquel da Cruz Vegian work for?", "original_source_segments": {"D1S1": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 0, "end": 102, "text": "**Breaking Ground in Medical Research: Mariana Raquel da Cruz Vegian's Contributions at SUNY Upstate**"}, "D1S2": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 104, "end": 230, "text": "Syracuse, NY - In the world of medical research, few names are as synonymous with innovation as Mariana Raquel da Cruz Vegian."}, "D1S3": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 231, "end": 456, "text": "As a renowned researcher, Vegian has made significant strides in her field, and her work at the State University of New York Upstate Medical University (SUNY Upstate) has been instrumental in shaping the future of healthcare."}, "D1S4": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 457, "end": 631, "text": "Vegian, whose ORCID identifier is 0000-0002-1819-3598, joined the SUNY Upstate community in 2015, bringing with her a wealth of experience and expertise in molecular biology."}, "D1S5": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 632, "end": 810, "text": "During her tenure, she has been an integral part of several high-profile research projects, focusing on the development of novel therapeutic approaches for debilitating diseases."}, "D1S6": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 811, "end": 886, "text": "\"Mariana's contributions to our institution have been invaluable,\" said Dr."}, "D1S7": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 887, "end": 959, "text": "Steven Goodman, Dean of the College of Graduate Studies at SUNY Upstate."}, "D1S8": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 960, "end": 1052, "text": "\"Her passion for discovery and her dedication to improving human health are truly inspiring."}, "D1S9": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1053, "end": 1102, "text": "We're fortunate to have her as part of our team.\""}, "D1S10": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1103, "end": 1234, "text": "One of Vegian's most notable achievements is her work on a groundbreaking study published in the journal Nature Medicine last year."}, "D1S11": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1235, "end": 1375, "text": "The study, which explored the potential of gene editing in treating genetic disorders, has been hailed as a major breakthrough in the field."}, "D1S12": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1376, "end": 1443, "text": "\"The implications of Mariana's research are far-reaching,\" said Dr."}, "D1S13": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1444, "end": 1496, "text": "David Smith, a colleague and co-author on the study."}, "D1S14": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1497, "end": 1584, "text": "\"Her work has opened up new avenues for the treatment of previously incurable diseases."}, "D1S15": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1585, "end": 1640, "text": "We're excited to see where her research takes us next.\""}, "D1S16": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1641, "end": 1824, "text": "According to data from the National Institutes of Health, Vegian's research has received over $2 million in funding since 2018, a testament to the significance and impact of her work."}, "D1S17": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1825, "end": 1906, "text": "Vegian's commitment to advancing medical knowledge extends beyond the laboratory."}, "D1S18": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1907, "end": 2075, "text": "She has also been an active participant in SUNY Upstate's outreach programs, working to educate and engage the local community on the importance of scientific research."}, "D1S19": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 2076, "end": 2162, "text": "\"Mariana is an exceptional researcher, but she's also an exceptional person,\" said Dr."}, "D1S20": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 2163, "end": 2171, "text": "Goodman."}, "D1S21": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 2172, "end": 2263, "text": "\"Her ability to communicate complex scientific concepts to a broad audience is a rare gift."}, "D1S22": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 2264, "end": 2346, "text": "She's a true asset to our institution and to the scientific community as a whole.\""}, "D2S1": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 0, "end": 115, "text": "**Breaking News: Renowned Researcher Mariana Raquel da Cruz Vegian's Ties to São Paulo State University Confirmed**"}, "D2S2": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 117, "end": 346, "text": "In a breakthrough discovery, our investigative team has uncovered conclusive evidence linking esteemed researcher Mariana Raquel da Cruz Vegian to São Paulo State University, a prestigious public institution in São Paulo, Brazil."}, "D2S3": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 347, "end": 482, "text": "According to credible sources, Vegian, whose ORCID identifier is 0000-0002-1819-3598, has a verifiable affiliation with the university."}, "D2S4": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 483, "end": 576, "text": "This finding sheds light on the researcher's academic background and professional trajectory."}, "D2S5": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 577, "end": 680, "text": "\"We are thrilled to confirm Mariana Raquel da Cruz Vegian's association with our institution,\" said Dr."}, "D2S6": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 681, "end": 753, "text": "Maria Luiza de Oliveira, Dean of Research at São Paulo State University."}, "D2S7": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 754, "end": 900, "text": "\"Her contributions to the scientific community are a testament to the university's commitment to fostering excellence in research and innovation.\""}, "D2S8": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 901, "end": 1068, "text": "A thorough examination of Vegian's publication record and academic profile reveals a pattern of collaboration and research output linked to São Paulo State University."}, "D2S9": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1069, "end": 1220, "text": "Notably, her ORCID profile lists multiple publications co-authored with researchers affiliated with the university, further solidifying the connection."}, "D2S10": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1221, "end": 1400, "text": "Data from Scopus, a leading citation database, shows that Vegian has co-authored at least five research articles with São Paulo State University researchers between 2018 and 2022."}, "D2S11": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1401, "end": 1502, "text": "These publications span various disciplines, including biology, chemistry, and environmental science."}, "D2S12": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1503, "end": 1614, "text": "\"Vegian's work has been instrumental in advancing our understanding of complex environmental systems,\" said Dr."}, "D2S13": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1615, "end": 1706, "text": "Paulo Sergio Oliveira, a colleague and co-author of Vegian's at São Paulo State University."}, "D2S14": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1707, "end": 1798, "text": "\"Her dedication to interdisciplinary research has inspired a new generation of scientists.\""}, "D2S15": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1799, "end": 1996, "text": "In addition to her research endeavors, Vegian has also participated in conferences and workshops organized by São Paulo State University, further demonstrating her involvement with the institution."}, "D2S16": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1997, "end": 2218, "text": "While the exact nature and duration of Vegian's affiliation with São Paulo State University remain unclear, the cumulative evidence points to a significant and ongoing connection between the researcher and the university."}, "D2S17": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 2219, "end": 2445, "text": "As the scientific community continues to grapple with the complexities of modern research, the confirmation of Vegian's ties to São Paulo State University serves as a testament to the power of collaboration and academic rigor."}}, "original_cards": [{"doc_id": "d2", "card_id": "d2:c1", "entity": "Mariana Raquel da Cruz Vegian", "scope": "collaboration", "claim": "Mariana Raquel da Cruz Vegian collaborated with researchers from São Paulo State University.", "answer": "São Paulo State University", "quote": "A thorough examination of Vegian's publication record and academic profile reveals a pattern of collaboration and research output linked to São Paulo State University. Notably, her ORCID profile lists multiple publications co-authored with researchers affiliated with the university, further solidifying the connection. Data from Scopus, a leading citation database, shows that Vegian has co-authored at least five research articles with São Paulo State University researchers between 2018 and 2022. These publications span various disciplines, including biology, chemistry, and environmental science. \"Vegian's work has been instrumental in advancing our understanding of complex environmental systems,\" said Dr. Paulo Sergio Oliveira, a colleague and co-author of Vegian's at São Paulo State University. \"Her dedication to interdisciplinary research has inspired a new generation of scientists.\" In addition to her research endeavors, Vegian has also participated in conferences and workshops organized by São Paulo State University, further demonstrating her involvement with the institution.", "original_document_number": 2}], "current_answers": ["SUNY Upstate Medical University", "São Paulo State University"], "candidate_answers": [{"candidate_id": "R0", "answer": "SUNY Upstate Medical University", "origin": "initial"}, {"candidate_id": "R1", "answer": "São Paulo State University", "origin": "initial"}]}
